      "id": "19",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第1节 前置条件",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "开始之前，我们确保系统上已经安装好conda 及python环境。并下载好fay代码包，通过终端进入到代码根目录。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第2节 安装独立虚拟环境",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "我们使用conda 新建一个python 3.12的干净虚拟环境。请在终端输入如下命令。并等待完成，期间应该提问是否安装的，输入\"y\"回车即可。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nPlain Text\nconda create -n funasr312 python=3.12\n",
      "type": "block docx-fallback-block fallback-async-code fallback-async-align-"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第3节 激活虚拟环境",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "输入如何命令激活虚拟环境。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nPlain Text\nconda activate funasr312\n",
      "type": "block docx-fallback-block fallback-async-code fallback-async-align-"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第4节 安装依赖",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "在终端输入如下命令安装依赖。等待安装完成。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\npip install -r .\\asr\\funasr\\requirments.txt\n",
      "type": "block docx-code-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第5节 启动funasr",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "终端中进入funasr目录，并输入如下合令启动。首次启动会自动下载权重文件，等待完成。看到loaded字眼，代表已经成功了。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\npython -u ASR_server.py --host \"0.0.0.0\" --port 10197 --ngpu 0\n",
      "type": "block docx-code-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "第6节 fay配置funasr",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "38",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "fay中修改根目录system.conf中asr_mode为funasr，local_asr_ip为127.0.0.1，local_asr_port为10197,重启fay完成配置。这里要注意，使用了本地配置，请确保在system.conf的必要配置必须完整。同时根目录还必须保留config.json文件，否则系统会判断本地配置不完整，将自动使用公共配置。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
